      "content": "i dont know, it doesnt feel like a connection. it feels like a void. like the more people there are, the less any single person actually matters. it's just math, really. one person out of millions... it's basically zero. it feels more true than anything else i feel. like the world is just this giant machine that doesn't even require me to function.",
